; one loop for the next: HasLoadIncome, set by the loop in @load_income whose
; loads take their income from a PHI, was never reset, so the loop in
; @no_load_income looked for load PHIs it does not have and crashed in
; createHeaderLoadPhi. @no_load_income must be pipelined as it is when it is
; alone in a module.

